    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics is my passion and a natural extension of my love for physics. I find joy in solving complex problems and appreciate its logical structure. As a physics student, I see math as the language of the universe, helping me model real-world phenomena. I enjoy how it connects abstract concepts to tangible results.",
